      "tag": "a perfect matching exists",
      "text": "refused whole: two movers and two eaten with a unique perfect matching (m1->e2, m2->e1) are called ambiguous because the contested test is per-track, not per-matching. Sound but incomplete -- a real hand-over goes unrepaired.",
      "verdict": "note"
